{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Do not classify discarded unknown fields as preserved details.** Every unknown key is treated as nonempty even when its value is `undefined`, but `DurableOperationError.fromErrorObject` ignores unknown keys. Thus `{ FutureDetail: undefined }` fabricates a generic `Unknown error`, while a defined future field loses its actual value. Either preserve defined unknown fields on the emitted error or ignore unsupported keys, and make the test assert the field's value rather than only the error instance.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs78RYM-","finding_digest":"d94b13925de13f929bcde1771412a3892a8f913b2055c6e240c5aba5c0f3547b","finding_id":"arf_v1_3ffrhes54e7zfg6n4f3rievdre","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","line":46,"observation_digest":"b8d79269da424e217974313bf3cbf4f0317f4738ea66235c6f3dcaf74a92228e","observation_id":"aro_v1_xdlze2o2ijhcc6luge57hs7u6a","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-09T16:42:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vgyn5dt33lgqphhzqdqcca2u3v","reviewed_base_sha":"4ce0ae50323820c74cd4864b7fb29ce3f3822083","reviewed_head_sha":"a26f64a0f433217fcf92ed2af03eea49d12c8c5d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":42,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_vdw34ajlye3eciwnuaqp7mrtl4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T16:42:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
